{"page":85,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:38","surah":4,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ يُنفِقُونَ أَمْوَٰلَهُمْ رِئَآءَ ٱلنَّاسِ وَلَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱللَّهِ وَلَا بِٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ ۗ وَمَن يَكُنِ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ لَهُۥ قَرِينًا فَسَآءَ قَرِينًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Nor does He like those] who spend their wealth to show off, who do not believe in Him or the Last Day. Whoever has Satan as his companion has an evil companion!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُنفِقُونَ","en_gloss":"spend","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَمْوَٰلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their wealth","transliteration":"amwālahum","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رِئَآءَ","en_gloss":"to be seen","transliteration":"riāa","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"(by) the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"they believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِٱلْيَوْمِ","en_gloss":"in the Day","transliteration":"bil-yawmi","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ ۗ","en_gloss":"the Last","transliteration":"l-ākhiri","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَكُنِ","en_gloss":"has","transliteration":"yakuni","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"4:38"},{"pos":16,"ar":"قَرِينًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) companion ","transliteration":"qarīnan